#42750
"On an Obsidian Wall"
"This vertical rock wall of smooth obsidian rises out of a river of lava below.

Deep notches have been carved into the walls, creating regular hand-holds.

You can climb onto a ledge to the east, or follow the wall to the west, where

you can see a cave opening.

"
